    old "Sarah gracefully bowed her head."
    new "サラは優雅に頭を下げた。"

    old "Yes, I do."
    new "はい、そうします。"

    old "The priest waved his hands in ceremony."
    new "司祭は儀式として両手を振った。"

    old "Then before me, as a representative of the gods, I declare you husband and wife."
    new "では、神々の代表として、私はあなた方を夫婦であると宣言します。"

    old "Absent an audience, there were no cheers."
    new "観客がいなかったため、歓声もなかった。"

    old "But Sarah suddenly felt Belmont's strong arms wrap around her waist, lifting her off the grounds and pulling her into a deep kiss."
    new "しかし、サラは突然、ベルモント船長の強い腕が自分の腰を包み込み、地面から持ち上げられ、深いキスへと引き寄せられるのを感じた。"

    old "Sarah eagerly returned the kiss, pressing her tongue deep into his mouth."
