    old "Sarah felt him rip her dress off her."
    new "サラは彼が自分のドレスを剥ぎ取るのを感じた。"

    old "Right on this altar, to be exact."
    new "正確には、この祭壇の上でだ。"

    old "She felt his powerful hands grip her waist and lift her up like she was nothing."
    new "彼女は彼の力強い手が腰を掴み、まるで自分など何でもないかのように持ち上げるのを感じた。"

    old "He sat her back down on the altar, the cold stone pressing up against her now exposed ass."
